X:13
T:Gramachree Molly. Dal.013
T:Grad Mo Croide a Maire,aka. Dal.013
B:R.Dalton MS, 1841, Sheffield
Z:Village Music Project 2019 Rob Lands
M:C
L:1/8
Q:1/4=100
N:Possibly Irish or Scottish Air, words for song of this name by George Ogle ~1774
N:Tune probably much earlier and was the subject of Johann Christian Fischer's (1733 -1800)
N:Concerto no.7 in F for oboe. Variations on Gramachree Molly in Movement 3.
N:MS has an extra Bar Line half way through first bar of "Song"
N:https://www.notamos.co.uk/detail.php?scoreid=146298
