T:Long Long Ago. Dal.014
T:Cluster of Nuts,aka. Dal.014
B:R.Dalton MS, 1841, Sheffield
Z:Village Music Project 2019 Rob Lands
M:C
L:1/8
Q:1/4=100
N:A song by Thomas Haynes Bayly in 1833(1797-1839)
N:There are many arrangements and composed variations on
N:the tune attributed to others.
N:The tune is used for Morris Dancing as Clusters of Nuts
N:It is sometimes attributed to Anon of Ireland
